OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve fly-tip costs
OL,4,Acharity #13k to clear
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral tonnes of fly-tipped waste took
OL,7,Fmore than a week to clear, costing a
OL,8,Fcharity more than #13,000.
OL,10,FThe Wildlife Trust for Beds, Cambs and
OL,11,FNorthants said the rubbish was dumped
OL,12,Fat the Fancott Wood and Meadows nature
OL,13,Freserve, close to Toddington,
OL,14,FBedfordshire, in August.
OL,16,FIt appeared overnight in its wildlife
OL,17,Fmeadow and included flooring,
OL,18,Fmattresses, rubble, plastic, broken
OL,19,Fglass, insulating foam, gas canisters,
OL,20,Fappliances and plasterboard.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
