OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve fly-tip costs
OL,4,Acharity #13k to clear
OL,5,
OL,6,FAidan Matthews, its senior reserves
OL,7,Fmanager, said: "It is unbelievable that
OL,8,Fsomeone thinks a nature reserve is an
OL,9,Facceptable place to dump waste like
OL,10,Fthis."
